WEBVTT

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:45.250
<i>we wanna be there even if we had to</i>
<i>twist the world all around to get there</i>

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:56.125
<i>without you, i guess i couldn't</i>
<i>even find the future here today</i>

00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:07.125
<i>i was always trying to take nothing for granted</i>

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:15.125
<i>for the day i might lose them</i>

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:22.167
<i>but you just came in to my black</i>
<i>and white monochrome destiny</i>

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:32.375
<i>and colored it all over</i>

00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:39.750
<i>we won't be satisfied with the routine future</i>

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:47.167
<i>we were born to make a new history come true</i>

00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:54.333
<i>there's absolutely no</i>
<i>absolute thing in this world</i>

00:01:54.333 --> 00:01:58.917
<i>this road goes on forever</i>

00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:05.042
<i>as long as we won't give up</i>

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.000
"Soul Resonance!"

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:15.750
Kill them... Kill them...

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:22.208
Killed them... Kill... Kill them... Kill...

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:23.458
Meme, do you hear me?!

00:02:23.458 --> 00:02:25.458
Are you all right, Miss Meme?!

00:02:25.458 --> 00:02:29.958
--Kill... Kill... Kill...
--Imagine, you two being able to find us here!

00:02:29.958 --> 00:02:31.542
You must be Shaula, right?

00:02:31.542 --> 00:02:33.833
Give us back Meme!

00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:36.958
How adorable.

00:02:36.958 --> 00:02:40.250
Would you like me to let you join her?

00:02:41.542 --> 00:02:43.958
Don't you touch Meme!

00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:49.125
You can't decide who you want
for your partner, can you, Tsugumi?

00:02:49.125 --> 00:02:51.500
Spying on others is in poor taste!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.458
How about I choose for you?

00:02:54.458 --> 00:02:58.917
She will die at any time, if I order it.

00:02:58.917 --> 00:03:00.208
Don't!

00:03:02.458 --> 00:03:04.875
How contemptible!

00:03:04.875 --> 00:03:10.167
Calm down. She's not the sort
of person that can be reasoned with.

00:03:10.167 --> 00:03:13.625
Now then, I'm through dealing with you children.

00:03:13.625 --> 00:03:18.958
You two stand there and watch.
History needs eyewitnesses.

00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:21.833
We aren't going to be
spectators that sit out doing nothing!

00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:24.333
If you interfere, I'll kill you.

00:03:24.333 --> 00:03:26.083
Now be quiet and watch.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:31.500
First, I'll take control of the
easily manageable NOT group.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:35.333
Perfect soldiers who feel neither fear nor pain.

00:03:36.125 --> 00:03:39.292
At my suggestion, they will
attack the other students,

00:03:39.292 --> 00:03:42.250
and their poison will
inflict a secondary infection.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:45.375
While at the same time,
they will scatter throughout the city,

00:03:45.375 --> 00:03:47.375
where they will pick up my magic,

00:03:47.375 --> 00:03:51.042
and serve as catalysts to spread it forth.

00:03:51.042 --> 00:03:53.375
Soul Protect release!

00:04:06.542 --> 00:04:07.708
What?

00:04:09.375 --> 00:04:12.792
Okay, it's Halloween! Enjoy yourselves!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.042
Wha--?!

00:04:38.083 --> 00:04:39.625
Send more people out to the square!

00:04:39.625 --> 00:04:41.458
--Get the antidote to clinical trials right away.
--Don't wait for instructions! Deal with them on-site!

00:04:41.458 --> 00:04:42.250
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:42.833
Where's the witch?!

00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:45.750
We can't locate her!
There's intense jamming all over the city,

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:46.792
disabling our searches!

00:04:46.792 --> 00:04:51.083
I don't want any whining!
We don't have any time to waste!

00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:52.542
Here they come!

00:05:10.958 --> 00:05:12.292
Here goes!

00:05:19.042 --> 00:05:19.833
This is going on forever!

00:05:19.833 --> 00:05:22.250
It's becoming a stressful battle!

00:05:29.458 --> 00:05:32.083
What do we do, Akane?
The way things are headed, we're in trouble!

00:05:32.083 --> 00:05:35.292
But we can't kill them, either.

00:05:35.292 --> 00:05:37.458
Your compassion is pointless.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:44.167
Damn!

00:05:48.542 --> 00:05:52.500
This is my one chance to
freely go hunting in this town!

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:55.333
I'm going to enjoy myself, too!

00:05:56.417 --> 00:05:58.000
Kill them.

00:06:03.917 --> 00:06:05.208
Miss Tsugumi, over there!

00:06:05.208 --> 00:06:07.208
Right!

00:06:07.208 --> 00:06:10.333
Meme, we're coming to help you right now!

00:06:10.333 --> 00:06:15.042
Kill them... Kill them... Kill them!

00:06:16.833 --> 00:06:18.667
Miss Tsugumi, stand back!

00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:22.583
Miss Tsugumi!

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:31.167
I'm okay! So is the antidote!

00:06:31.167 --> 00:06:36.208
Kill... Kill...

00:06:36.208 --> 00:06:38.042
Kill...

00:06:46.375 --> 00:06:48.958
Miss Meme, please bear with me for a moment.

00:06:48.958 --> 00:06:51.167
I promise, I will help you out.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:06.958
Miss Anya!

00:07:06.958 --> 00:07:08.375
Are you all right?

00:07:08.375 --> 00:07:12.042
Y-Yes. I will subdue Miss Meme.

00:07:12.042 --> 00:07:16.292
Miss Tsugumi, when I do,
please give her the medicine.

00:07:16.292 --> 00:07:18.917
Mm-hmm, I'll try.

00:07:27.917 --> 00:07:32.333
Kill them... Kill them...

00:07:32.333 --> 00:07:34.583
Hold on. Meme!

00:07:38.792 --> 00:07:40.583
Kill them...

00:07:40.583 --> 00:07:43.208
Miss Tsugumi, quickly, the medicine!

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:51.500
That was crazy! What if you had hit yourself?!

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:55.375
Kill... Kill...

00:07:56.958 --> 00:07:59.500
I'm...

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.792
I'm a weapon, too.

00:08:09.292 --> 00:08:10.458
Kill...

00:08:12.958 --> 00:08:13.958
Kill...

00:08:14.875 --> 00:08:16.500
Kill...

00:08:17.042 --> 00:08:18.458
Kill...

00:08:19.542 --> 00:08:21.083
Miss Tsugumi!

00:08:30.708 --> 00:08:32.500
Ugh! Bitter!

00:08:35.542 --> 00:08:36.792
Miss Meme!

00:08:36.792 --> 00:08:38.417
Meme...

00:08:39.542 --> 00:08:43.000
Tsu... gumi...

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:46.125
Meme!

00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:48.875
Kill...

00:08:48.875 --> 00:08:51.250
Why?!

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:53.458
Kill them... Kill them...

00:08:53.458 --> 00:08:56.500
--Meme! Have you already forgotten us?!
--Kill them... Kill them... Kill them...

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:59.417
--Miss Tsugumi, stay back!
--Kill them... Kill them... Kill them...

00:08:59.417 --> 00:09:01.000
Kill them...

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:05.958
Kill them... Kill... them... Kill... them...

00:09:05.958 --> 00:09:11.042
--Miss Anya, wait! Meme! Do you remember, Meme?
--Kill... them... Kill... them...

00:09:11.042 --> 00:09:11.958
--Kill... them... Kill...

00:09:11.958 --> 00:09:16.833
--The precious times that we spent together--you, me, and Miss Anya?
--Kill... them... Kill...

00:09:18.708 --> 00:09:23.542
We all cooked our meals together,
and worked at the café, remember?

00:09:23.542 --> 00:09:26.417
Meme, you would always
forget the orders right away,

00:09:26.417 --> 00:09:31.042
and always make too much supper,
and goof everything up,

00:09:31.042 --> 00:09:35.042
but for the three of us, it really was fun.

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:43.167
Miss Tsugumi!

00:09:43.167 --> 00:09:44.625
I'm all right!

00:09:46.333 --> 00:09:52.583
I'm all right. Meme, we also grew
our pumpkins together, remember?

00:09:54.792 --> 00:09:56.333
You remember, don't you?

00:09:59.417 --> 00:10:03.417
♪ Scribbles in my notebook ♪

00:10:03.417 --> 00:10:07.000
♪ The breeze coming from the window ♪

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:10.083
♪ Every time our gazes meet ♪

00:10:10.083 --> 00:10:14.458
♪ I give you a happy wink ♪

00:10:14.458 --> 00:10:18.000
♪ Anywhere I see our dreams ♪

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:21.750
♪ reflected in anything else ♪

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:25.125
♪ The times pass by too quickly ♪

00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:28.667
♪ as though they were in a rush ♪

00:10:28.667 --> 00:10:33.125
♪ Suddenly, before you know it, ♪

00:10:33.125 --> 00:10:36.333
♪ they are tightening up ♪

00:10:36.333 --> 00:10:39.667
♪ as tight as a school uniform ♪

00:10:39.667 --> 00:10:45.167
♪ What do we have in our hands? ♪

00:10:45.167 --> 00:10:48.667
♪ Ah, you've always been competing ♪

00:10:48.667 --> 00:10:52.583
♪ here at my side ♪

00:10:52.583 --> 00:10:56.458
♪ it's because you're here with me ♪

00:10:56.458 --> 00:11:01.000
♪ that I was able to come this far ♪

00:11:02.708 --> 00:11:05.125
Meme! Meme!

00:11:05.125 --> 00:11:08.458
Meme! Meme! Meme!

00:11:08.458 --> 00:11:11.333
I heard you, Tsugumi...

00:11:14.625 --> 00:11:19.458
I hadn't forgotten... about all those things...

00:11:19.458 --> 00:11:20.958
Miss Meme!

00:11:22.625 --> 00:11:26.750
Tsugumi... Miss Anya...

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:28.833
How... could I...?

00:11:28.833 --> 00:11:30.000
Are you all right?!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.375
Completely!

00:11:32.667 --> 00:11:33.833
Ow!

00:11:34.708 --> 00:11:36.417
I'm so sorry.

00:11:36.417 --> 00:11:39.042
It's okay. It's over now.

00:11:39.042 --> 00:11:43.000
Mm-mm. It's not over yet.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:47.000
I can hear her--the witch's voice.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.292
I'm still connected to her.

00:11:50.292 --> 00:11:54.917
Her voice... Her voice, which
is still controlling a lot of people.

00:11:56.875 --> 00:12:02.750
I'm scared... that someone else
I care about might get hurt.

00:12:09.708 --> 00:12:14.333
Miss Anya, Meme, I've made up my mind.

00:12:14.333 --> 00:12:16.542
About who I'm choosing for my partner.

00:12:16.542 --> 00:12:18.875
What do you mean? At a time like this?

00:12:24.417 --> 00:12:26.250
I choose both of you as my partner!

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:27.375
Huh?!

00:12:27.375 --> 00:12:30.000
What are you talking about? That's crazy!

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:34.208
I've never heard of one
weapon having two meisters!

00:12:34.208 --> 00:12:35.625
Does that mean no?

00:12:35.625 --> 00:12:40.208
Huh? No, it's not like I'm turning you down...

00:12:40.208 --> 00:12:43.250
I've found that my...

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:48.583
...soul has resonated a little bit in
both of your hearts... and I knew...

00:12:48.583 --> 00:12:52.958
...we could probably resonate with all three of us.

00:12:54.917 --> 00:12:58.083
Sometime, when all three
of us have grown some more,

00:12:58.083 --> 00:13:01.292
the day when we'll split up may come along,

00:13:01.292 --> 00:13:06.083
but right now, we--the three
of us, together, are strongest!

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:14.417
We have to report to the teachers
about the antidote and the witch.

00:13:14.417 --> 00:13:15.667
Yes, of course.

00:13:15.667 --> 00:13:20.417
I might be helpful in locating Shaula.

00:13:20.417 --> 00:13:24.667
I can follow her voice, the same
way Shaula was spying through me.

00:13:24.667 --> 00:13:25.583
Like tracing her call!

00:13:25.583 --> 00:13:27.958
Let's hurry back to DWMA!

00:13:32.833 --> 00:13:35.167
--Oh!
--Let's go!

00:13:39.958 --> 00:13:41.958
Aren't we a little heavy?

00:13:41.958 --> 00:13:43.875
That's Miss Meme.

00:13:59.625 --> 00:14:02.167
I hope everyone is okay.

00:14:02.167 --> 00:14:03.792
What about the girls' dorm?

00:14:03.792 --> 00:14:07.625
If anything happens,
Miss Kim and Miss Jackie are there.

00:14:07.625 --> 00:14:10.667
I asked for some more help, too, just in case.

00:14:10.667 --> 00:14:12.333
More help?

00:14:16.583 --> 00:14:19.375
Be careful, Kim!
Miss Misery is not her usual self!

00:14:19.375 --> 00:14:20.958
I know!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.958
Easy there, Miss Kana! Ow, that hurts!

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:39.958
Patty!

00:14:40.542 --> 00:14:42.917
You betcha!

00:14:50.292 --> 00:14:53.042
DWMA students are pretty sloppy, huh?

00:14:55.167 --> 00:14:57.333
Miss Liz? Miss Patty?

00:15:04.625 --> 00:15:06.333
Can you trace her?

00:15:13.875 --> 00:15:16.708
Shaula!

00:15:16.708 --> 00:15:17.708
Why, you...!

00:15:17.708 --> 00:15:19.208
Oh! She's spotted us!

00:15:19.208 --> 00:15:20.042
Huh?!

00:15:20.042 --> 00:15:22.458
She's coming! Tsugumi, move faster!

00:15:22.458 --> 00:15:25.000
Uh, mm-hmm!

00:15:28.917 --> 00:15:30.458
You're not going anywhere!

00:15:41.583 --> 00:15:45.583
Imagine, you breaking my mind control...

00:15:45.583 --> 00:15:48.083
I'm a bit surprised.

00:15:48.083 --> 00:15:52.083
It just means that you're not
as smart as you think you are.

00:15:52.917 --> 00:15:59.000
Come back to me. If you do,
I will spare the other two's lives.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.000
Do you remember?

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:04.167
When the two of us killed Sid?

00:16:04.167 --> 00:16:05.875
Don't listen to her!

00:16:08.083 --> 00:16:11.167
Of course I remember that.

00:16:11.167 --> 00:16:14.208
The hard times... and the fun times...

00:16:15.333 --> 00:16:19.875
I'm never forgetting anything important again.

00:16:19.875 --> 00:16:21.958
Meme, Miss Anya...

00:16:21.958 --> 00:16:23.958
Right!

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:35.625
Imagine... the blade lying
dormant within my soul...

00:16:35.625 --> 00:16:38.792
Please, awaken.

00:16:38.792 --> 00:16:41.000
I want to protect these two who are dear to me.

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.625
Soul Resonance!

00:16:55.125 --> 00:16:56.667
A blade!

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.542
All right!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.083
Royal spear technique!

00:17:19.833 --> 00:17:21.458
Don't press your luck!

00:17:28.292 --> 00:17:30.250
Meme! Miss Anya!

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:31.542
We're all right.

00:17:41.375 --> 00:17:43.500
--Let's go, Tsugumi!
--Let's go, Miss Tsugumi!

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:44.542
Right!

00:17:49.042 --> 00:17:51.208
Shaula!

00:17:55.833 --> 00:17:57.333
Hop on!

00:18:21.875 --> 00:18:25.625
Spring Bird Attack!!

00:18:50.042 --> 00:18:52.417
It's Shaula...

00:18:52.417 --> 00:18:55.375
Did we... win?

00:19:01.917 --> 00:19:05.792
What was that--that
"Spring Bird Attack" earlier?

00:19:05.792 --> 00:19:06.708
Huh?

00:19:06.708 --> 00:19:09.083
That was, I mean...

00:19:09.083 --> 00:19:10.333
You know.

00:19:10.333 --> 00:19:14.458
Geez, please don't go assigning
weird names without asking first.

00:19:54.833 --> 00:19:56.833
What's going on?

00:19:56.833 --> 00:19:59.625
In any event, it looks like it's over.

00:20:05.917 --> 00:20:08.208
The witch's readings have vanished.

00:20:08.208 --> 00:20:10.417
The same with the noise
that was blanketing the city.

00:20:10.417 --> 00:20:14.125
Looks like I get off without
having to dissect a student, huh?

00:20:14.125 --> 00:20:16.542
Well, I'll be going, then.

00:20:16.542 --> 00:20:20.000
There are a lot of injured people.
I hate to ask, but...

00:20:22.333 --> 00:20:25.500
You just keep pushing me ever harder.

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:28.500
There's still no way I'll ever
become a teacher, though.

00:20:32.375 --> 00:20:34.000
Akane!

00:20:35.958 --> 00:20:38.375
Harudori! Tatane?!

00:20:40.083 --> 00:20:41.708
Hey, are you all right?

00:20:41.708 --> 00:20:43.542
Yes, more or less.

00:20:44.542 --> 00:20:45.708
Is that...?

00:20:45.708 --> 00:20:47.333
It happened when we defeated Shaula.

00:20:47.333 --> 00:20:49.375
Huh? For real?!

00:20:50.583 --> 00:20:55.250
Don't be so surprised.
We <i>are </i>DWMA students, after all.

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:58.292
Albeit from NOT.

00:20:58.292 --> 00:21:01.542
I beg your pardon, Princess Anya.

00:21:01.542 --> 00:21:03.083
Princess?

00:21:04.208 --> 00:21:05.833
Maka, let's go.

00:21:05.833 --> 00:21:06.958
Mm-hmm.

00:21:10.167 --> 00:21:11.417
Good work.

00:21:11.417 --> 00:21:13.583
Here.

00:21:13.583 --> 00:21:17.708
Somehow, you suddenly seem a lot more promising.

00:21:17.708 --> 00:21:19.875
I've chosen my partner!

00:21:19.875 --> 00:21:21.042
--It's me!
--It's me!

00:21:21.042 --> 00:21:22.125
Huh?

00:21:25.083 --> 00:21:29.250
<i>With a big wave and a "See you,"</i>

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:36.125
<i>let's meet in the new day</i>

00:21:37.583 --> 00:21:40.417
Despite going through such
an incredibly awful experience,

00:21:40.417 --> 00:21:43.417
our usual lives soon started up once again,

00:21:43.417 --> 00:21:45.708
and winter came to Death City.

00:21:46.958 --> 00:21:51.250
The seniors all carried on as usual.
That's DWMA for you.

00:21:52.792 --> 00:21:57.333
Afterward, Miss Anya
went back to her family castle,

00:21:57.333 --> 00:22:00.292
to give a full report of the incident.

00:22:00.292 --> 00:22:02.333
It must be hard being a princess.

00:22:03.458 --> 00:22:06.208
Meme checked into the hospital for a bit,

00:22:06.208 --> 00:22:08.958
to be checked to make
sure the magic really is gone.

00:22:08.958 --> 00:22:11.625
It sounds like it will take a little time.

00:22:12.625 --> 00:22:15.500
I'm a little lonesome without my partners,

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:17.667
but in the meantime, I'll keep on plugging away.

00:22:17.667 --> 00:22:20.583
I have to at least catch up
to the other two a little.

00:22:20.583 --> 00:22:23.458
I can't just keep on being a 14-year-old

00:22:23.458 --> 00:22:24.958
who's in love with love forever, after all.

00:23:06.667 --> 00:23:08.833
Yo, Tsugumi!

00:23:08.833 --> 00:23:10.750
Miss Liz! Miss Patty!

00:23:10.750 --> 00:23:12.625
Heya!

00:23:12.625 --> 00:23:14.542
You've become partners, I see.

00:23:14.542 --> 00:23:17.625
Ugh... The guy really is a nag.

00:23:17.625 --> 00:23:19.125
Hey, Liz!

00:23:19.125 --> 00:23:21.833
How many times have
I told you to stay symmetrical?!

00:23:21.833 --> 00:23:24.792
When standing still,
you keep me in the center, like this!

00:23:24.792 --> 00:23:26.250
--Like this! Symmetry is my aesthetic!
Don't I keep saying so?!

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:27.208
--See you.
--Like this! Symmetry is my aesthetic!

00:23:27.208 --> 00:23:29.458
--Right!
--Don't I keep saying so?!

00:23:29.458 --> 00:23:32.042
For crying out loud!
Can't you listen more closely to me?!

00:23:33.167 --> 00:23:35.833
All right, say it! Ready, set, "Symmetry!"

00:23:35.833 --> 00:23:38.292
Tsugumi!

00:23:38.292 --> 00:23:39.500
Meme!

00:23:39.500 --> 00:23:42.000
Long time no see!

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:43.292
Have you been okay?

00:23:43.292 --> 00:23:46.125
Yes! You grew your hair out, huh?

00:23:46.125 --> 00:23:49.250
What about <i>you</i>, Meme?
Your body keeps on filling out!

00:23:49.250 --> 00:23:51.042
I just want to plump them!

00:23:51.042 --> 00:23:52.667
Stop making out!

00:23:54.292 --> 00:23:55.583
Miss Anya!

00:23:55.583 --> 00:23:58.167
Please, grow up a little bit!

00:23:58.167 --> 00:24:00.500
Come on, let's go, Princess!

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:03.458
Hey, cut that "Princess" business out!

00:24:03.458 --> 00:24:05.542
Let's go, Princess!

00:24:05.542 --> 00:24:07.083
Geez, not you, too, Meme!

00:24:07.083 --> 00:24:08.958
It sounds like you're calling a dog.

00:24:08.958 --> 00:24:11.042
Miss Anya, your uniform is cute.

00:24:11.042 --> 00:24:12.500
Mm-hmm, and such pretty legs!

00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:15.375
H-Hey! Well, Miss Tsugumi,
you've still got "commaries"!

00:24:15.375 --> 00:24:17.046
Gagantous!
